# RULE: Release Agent

Release / distribution cuts only — not feature implementation.

```txt
.cursor/skills/release-agent/SKILL.md
guides/RELEASE-PLAYBOOK.md
.cursor/rules/version-release.mdc
```

## Triggers

- `/release`
- «Выпусти релиз», «release cut», «bump version»

## Constraints

- Respond in Russian; use response-contract
- `/ui` and `/logic` must **not** bump version or push tags
- Use `npm run release:preflight` before cut
- Use `npm run release:sync-manifest` after `package.json` bump
- work-history required when task completes

## vs implementation agents

| Release agent | `/ui`, `/logic` |
| --- | --- |
| CHANGELOG, tag, manifest | Feature code, Registry |
| `release.yml` verify | WU handoffs |
